# Line endings are LF in the repository, whatever the checkout platform does.
#
# Without this, a Windows tool that writes in text mode turns every line of a
# file into a change: a one-line edit landed as 2 585 modified lines and made
# the diff unreviewable. `text=auto` lets git normalise on commit rather than
# trusting each editor to behave.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
